    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is Charlie. How can I help you?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167283966666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return a helmet. Order number is VF-75113.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 10830,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167288833332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment while I pull that up for you... I see the Velo-Pro helmet. To get this started, could you tell me what specifically is the issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167292499998
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no issue. The color is wrong. It's a gift that didn't work out. Can I return it or not?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 10830,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167302433331
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. And just to be sure, the box is unopened and there's no concern about the safety features of the helmet, correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167308966664
    },
    {
      "text": "Correct. It hasn't been touched. The box is unopened. Yes or no on the return?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 10830,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167317633330
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I see the order was delivered 69 days ago, and our policy allows returns for up to 90 days on standard items. You're well within that window.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167323033330
    },
    {
      "text": "Finally. So what do I do?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 10830,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167333766663
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just processed the return authorization. I'm emailing you a pre-paid shipping label right now. Simply print it, attach it to the original packaging, and you can drop it at any shipping center.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167335633329
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I see the email. That's all I needed. Thanks.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 10830,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766167348966662
    },
    {
